0..77 Comment "//! A theory constant written by its bare name in a rule and in a sort index."
78..81 Comment "//!"
82..159 Comment "//! A constant is an operation of no input, `oper bot : Grade`. A rule and an"
160..234 Comment "//! index name it often, and a call with no argument reads as noise there."
235..238 Comment "//!"
239..314 Comment "//! A rule side and an index term name a constant by its bare name, as they"
315..393 Comment "//! name a variable. The theory declares the name as a constant, so the reader"
394..469 Comment "//! reads that constant and not a variable. A name that the theory does not"
470..523 Comment "//! declare stays a variable, as `e` and `y` do here."
524..527 Comment "//!"
528..544 Comment "//! - see: #7913"
546..616 Comment "/// Choice with cut over a grade-indexed sort, its grades and commands"
617..695 Comment "/// constants. `cutLeft` commits to the left branch at any grade of the right."
